{"sectionId":"nomenclature/names","items":[{"id":"nomenclature--names-k001","sectionId":"nomenclature/names","unitId":"nomenclature","subject":"chemistry","text":"유기 명명에서는 주요 작용기를 포함하는 적절한 모체를 선택하고 번호를 매긴다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"nomenclature--names-k002","sectionId":"nomenclature/names","unitId":"nomenclature","subject":"chemistry","text":"치환기, 다중결합 및 접미사 작용기 위치를 IUPAC 우선순위 규칙에 맞춰 표시한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"nomenclature--names-k003","sectionId":"nomenclature/names","unitId":"nomenclature","subject":"chemistry","text":"단순 alkane 계열은 methane,ethane,propane,butane,pentane,hexane 순이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"nomenclature--names-k004","sectionId":"nomenclature/names","unitId":"nomenclature","subject":"chemistry","text":"이중·삼중결합은 -ene,-yne, alcohol은 -ol, aldehyde는 -al, ketone은 -one, carboxylic acid는 -oic acid를 대표 접미사로 사용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"nomenclature--names-k005","sectionId":"nomenclature/names","unitId":"nomenclature","subject":"chemistry","text":"산 유도체는 ester, amide, acyl halide 등으로 구분한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"nomenclature--names-k006","sectionId":"nomenclature/names","unitId":"nomenclature","subject":"chemistry","text":"작용기는 분자 내 반응성과 물리적 성질을 결정하는 구조 단위다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"nomenclature--names-k007","sectionId":"nomenclature/names","unitId":"nomenclature","subject":"chemistry","text":"ether R-O-R′, alcohol R-OH, aldehyde R-CHO, ketone R-CO-R′, acid R-COOH, ester R-COOR′, amide R-CONR′R″, amine R-NR′R″, nitrile R-C≡N을 구별한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"nomenclature--names-k008","sectionId":"nomenclature/names","unitId":"nomenclature","subject":"chemistry","text":"amine의 1·2·3차 구분은 N에 결합한 탄소 치환기 수, alcohol의 구분은 OH가 붙은 탄소의 탄소 이웃 수다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"nomenclature--names-k009","sectionId":"nomenclature/names","unitId":"nomenclature","subject":"chemistry","text":"aldehyde와 ketone은 모두 carbonyl을 갖지만 결합 구조가 다르다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"nomenclature--names-k010","sectionId":"nomenclature/names","unitId":"nomenclature","subject":"chemistry","text":"ester와 ether를 구별한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"nomenclature--names-k011","sectionId":"nomenclature/names","unitId":"nomenclature","subject":"chemistry","text":"amide의 N은 carbonyl 공명으로 amine과 성질이 다르다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"nomenclature--names-k012","sectionId":"nomenclature/names","unitId":"nomenclature","subject":"chemistry","text":"치환기와 주요 작용기의 우선순위는 명명 규칙에 따른다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"nomenclature--names-k013","sectionId":"nomenclature/names","unitId":"nomenclature","subject":"chemistry","text":"Methyl propanoate(프로판산 메틸)이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]}]}